<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/futb-crest.png">
    <title>Terms of Service - FUTB Housing</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css">
    <script src="/js/theme.js"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body class="bg-soft">
    <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-light bg-white border-bottom sticky-top shadow-sm">
        <div class="container">
            <a class="navbar-brand brand fw-bold" href="/" aria-label="FUTB Housing home"><img class="brand-logo" src="/futb-crest.png" alt="Federal University of Technology Babura crest">FUTB <span class="text-success">Housing</span></a>
            <div class="d-flex gap-3 align-items-center">
                <a class="nav-link text-dark" href="/properties"><i class="bi bi-buildings me-1"></i>Browse homes</a>
                <a class="nav-link text-dark" href="/privacy-policy">Privacy</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>
    <main class="container legal-page py-5">
        <header class="mb-4">
            <span class="eyebrow text-uppercase">FUTB Housing</span>
            <h1 class="fw-bold">Terms of Service</h1>
            <p class="text-muted mb-0">Last updated: October 27, 2026</p>
        </header>
        <article class="legal-document">
            <section>
                <h2>Using the service</h2>
                <p>FUTB Housing helps students discover rental listings near campus and helps landlords publish property information. By creating an account or using the service, you agree to these terms. You must provide accurate account information and keep your sign-in details secure.</p>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2>Accounts and listings</h2>
                <p>Use the service only for lawful rental activity. Landlords are responsible for having authority to list a property and for keeping its description, price, availability, video, and contact details accurate. Do not post misleading, unlawful, or unauthorized content. Students may submit one honest rating and comment for a property they have paid to rent.</p>
                <p>A verified label reflects the platform's listing review; it is not a guarantee of a property's condition, safety, ownership, or continued availability. Students should confirm important details with the landlord and inspect a property before making rental decisions.</p>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2>Bookings and payments</h2>
                <p>Where Paystack checkout is offered, payment is processed through Paystack. The app records payment references, amounts, statuses, and dates to manage bookings; it does not store payment card details. For listings with a verified landlord payout account, Paystack routes 99% of the payment to that subaccount and 1% to the platform. Paystack transaction fees are assigned to the landlord's share.</p>
                <p>A successful payment covers the monthly period shown in the booking flow. The booking page and payment provider show the amount before you pay. A student may cancel an active booking in the app, but cancellation does not automatically issue a refund. Contact the landlord and payment provider about any separate refund or tenancy dispute.</p>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2>Availability and changes</h2>
                <p>We work to keep the service available, but cannot promise uninterrupted access or that every listing will remain available. We may update features or these terms as the service changes. Continued use after updated terms are published means you accept the revised terms.</p>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2>Contact</h2>
                <p>For questions about these terms, contact the FUTB Housing administrator through the official channel provided by the service operator.</p>
            </section>
        </article>
    </main>
    <%- include('partials/legal-footer') %>
</body>
</html>